{"id":"16fe1cbe5ddb","path":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/contacts","lang":"en","title":"Contact us","description":"The Study Advisory Service is always available for information on the Master in International Tourism. Call us or send us an email today.","section":"Education","crumbs":["Education","Master","MT"],"image":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9.jpg?itok=P92hDBzr","words":167,"alternates":{"it":"/it/education/master/international-tourism/contacts","en":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/contacts"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Education","path":"/en/originalnode/8525"},{"label":"Master","path":"/en/originalnode/7757"},{"label":"MT","path":"/en/education/master/international-tourism"},{"label":"Contact us","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"gallery","items":[{"kind":"image","src":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/styles/usi_large/public/storage/images/orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9.jpg?itok=P92hDBzr","alt":"orientamento-correzione_obiettivo_-_9","caption":""}]},{"t":"html","html":"<p>The Study Advisory Service is always available for information on USI study programmes.</p> <p>The Service (located in the Main Building, Level 3, West Campus) is open Monday through Friday from 9:30 to 12:30 and 13:30 to 18:00.</p> <p>You can contact us by phone at +41 (0)58 666 4795 or by filling out the contact form:</p> <p><a href=\"https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fjoin.usi.ch%2Fen%2Fcontact-form&amp;data=05%7C02%7Canna.giovanetti%40usi.ch%7C571d5f624fe540a2677a08dc4e65fc6f%7C95bdc5acafb54881801b3874f365cd6f%7C0%7C0%7C638471447129247930%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=rMLYqEEcqeAfGau3r3hRIcl5nOWwkDLIYfAesGpD%2F9E%3D&amp;reserved=0\"><strong>Contact Us</strong></a></p><p>Do you have specific questions about the content of our <strong>USI Master in International Tourism programme</strong>? Please write us: <a href=\"mailto:mt@usi.ch\">mt@usi.ch</a></p> <p><strong>Scientific Director</strong><br> Prof. Dr <a href=\"https://search.usi.ch/en/people/c3153bd11a31b6f96024b89b182d629f/cantoni-lorenzo\">Lorenzo Cantoni</a></p> <p><strong>Programme assistant</strong><br> Eléonore Fortier (<a href=\"mailto:eleonore.fortier@usi.ch\">eleonore.fortier@usi.ch</a>)</p> <p><strong>USI Master in International Tourism community</strong><br> Join our USI Master in International Tourism community on <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/usi-master-in-international-tourism\">LinkedIn</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tourism_master_switzerland\">Instagram</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/usimt\">Facebook</a> to receive the latest updates around the USI Master in International Tourism.</p> <p><strong>Visit our Lugano campus</strong><br> Would you like to learn more about the USI Master in International Tourism while meeting us on our Lugano campus? Register online for the <a href=\"/en/education/master/international-tourism/open-days-study-advisory\">Master Info Day</a>, the <a href=\"/en/education/master/international-tourism/open-days-study-advisory\">Master Meetings</a>, or write to <a href=\"mailto:mt@usi.ch\">mt@usi.ch</a> to arrange your visit.</p>"}],"ctas":[{"label":"Apply Now","href":"/en/education-application"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"mailto:mt@usi.ch?subject=BTN Learn More"}],"nav":[{"label":"Overview","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism"},{"label":"Our students","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/our-students"},{"label":"Why study tourism?","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/why-tourism"},{"label":"Why study tourism at USI?","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/why-tourism-at-usi"},{"label":"Academic and industry collaborations","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/academics-industry-collaborations"},{"label":"Study plan","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/structure-and-contents"},{"label":"Double Degree (optional)","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/structure-and-contents/optional-double-degree"},{"label":"Employability","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects"},{"label":"Job Profiles","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects/job-profiles"},{"label":"Employers","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects/employers"},{"label":"Tourism Career Stories","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/career-prospects/career-stories"},{"label":"Application and admission","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/admission/academic-requirements"},{"label":"Fees and grants","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/fees-and-grants"},{"label":"Practical information","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/organising-your-studies"},{"label":"Open days and study advisory","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/open-days-study-advisory"},{"label":"FAQ","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/faq"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/news"},{"label":"Contact us","href":"/en/education/master/international-tourism/contacts"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/education/master/international-tourism/contacts","fetchedAt":"2026-10-09T20:07:59.567Z"}